["Recurrence: C[0]=0; C[j]=min over coins d≤j of (C[j−d]+1).","Time O(n·N) for n coins and amount N.","Space O(N).","Greedy works only for canonical coin systems (e.g. 1,5,10,25).","Counting ways variant uses addition instead of min.","Trace back with a 'last coin' array."],
